# Commit messages

Never add a Cursor co-author trailer to commit messages.

```text
# ❌ BAD
feat: add session writer

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>

# ✅ GOOD
feat: add session writer
```

- Do not append `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Co-authored-by: cursoragent@cursor.com`, or any equivalent trailer.
- If a hook or template inserts that trailer, amend only when the commit rules already allow an amend; otherwise create a new commit that does not include it.
- Keep Conventional Commits and the project changelog policy unchanged.
